<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Relegated definitions from Section <a href="#S3.SS3" title="3.3 Formal definitions ‣ 3 Setting the stage: definitions and features ‣ Toward Understanding the Transferability of Adversarial Suffixes in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.3</span></a></h2>

<div id="Thmdefinition7" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmdefinition7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 7</span></span><span id="Thmdefinition7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Optimal layer selection)</span></h6>
<div id="Thmdefinition7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmdefinition7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefinition7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="Thmdefinition7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l^{*}\in\{1,2,\ldots,L\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l^{*}\in\{1,2,\ldots,L\}</annotation></semantics></math> denote the optimal layer for extracting the refusal direction, where <math id="Thmdefinition7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> is the total number of layers in the model. The </span>optimal layer<span id="Thmdefinition7.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> <math id="Thmdefinition7.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> is selected as:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx1" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E1"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle l^{*}=\operatorname*{arg\,max}_{l\in\{1,2,\ldots,L\}}\text{Effectiveness}(\mathbf{v}_{\text{refusal}}^{l})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Effectiveness</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">refusal</mtext><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle l^{*}=\operatorname*{arg\,max}_{l\in\{1,2,\ldots,L\}}\text{Effectiveness}(\mathbf{v}_{\text{refusal}}^{l})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(1)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmdefinition7.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefinition7.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmdefinition7.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Effectiveness}(\mathbf{v}_{\text{refusal}}^{l})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Effectiveness</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐯</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">refusal</mtext><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Effectiveness}(\mathbf{v}_{\text{refusal}}^{l})</annotation></semantics></math> measures the success of the refusal direction at layer <math id="Thmdefinition7.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>l</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l</annotation></semantics></math> in changing model behavior, following <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">Arditi et al. [2024]</a></cite>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For brevity, in the paper we drop the layer superscript <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> when clear from context. All activations and refusal directions <math id="A1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{v}_{\text{refusal}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mtext>refusal</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}_{\text{refusal}}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{a}^{\text{base}}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{a}^{\text{base}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{a}^{\text{suffix}}_{ij}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mtext>suffix</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{a}^{\text{suffix}}_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math> are computed at the optimal layer <math id="A1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l^{*}</annotation></semantics></math> unless explicitly stated otherwise.</p>
</div>
</section>
